(text "One sheet per block. Every pin carries a global label with its net name, so equal labels join across sheets.\nFour isolated grounds: GND (logic), 0V_IO (field digital), AGND_ISO (analog), GND_485 (RS-485)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ccac8d7a-3962-55e6-9610-c6247f641e8e"))
